hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"145","[AI-translation] Hazrat Itban bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak main aankhon se mahjoob [nabina] hun, aur sailab mere aur masjid ke darmiyan haail hote hain; to kya mere liye koi uzr hai [ghar mein namaz ka]? To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum nida [azan] sunte ho?' Unhon ne kaha: Ji. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main tumhare liye koi uzr nahin pata, jab tum nida sunte ho.'"
"146","[AI-translation] Mahmud bin Rabi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Itban bin Malik Apni qaum ki imamat karte jabke woh nabina the; aur unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se kaha: Beshak andhera, barish aur sailab hote hain, aur main nabina aadmi hun; to Ya Rasulullah mere ghar mein ek jagah namaz padh den jise main namaz ki jagah bana lun. Ravi kehte hain: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) un ke paas tashreef lae aur farmaya: 'Tum kahan chahte ho ke main namaz padhun?' To unhon ne Aap ko ghar ki ek jagah ki taraf ishara kiya; to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us mein namaz padhi."
"147","[AI-translation] Mahmud bin Rabi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Itban bin Malik Apni qaum ki imamat karte jabke woh nabina the."
"148","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qasam Us ki jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, beshak main ne irada farmaya ke lakdiyon ka hukm dun aur woh ikatthi ki jayen, phir namaz ka hukm dun aur us ke liye azan kahi jae, phir ek aadmi ko hukm dun aur woh logon ki imamat kare, phir main us ki mukhalifat kar ke [namaz se peeche rehne wale] aadmiyon ki taraf jaun aur un par un ke ghar jala dun. Qasam Us ki jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, agar un mein se koi janta ke woh charbi wala haddi wala gosht ya do achche paye paega to Isha mein hazir hota.' Tahawi kehte hain: [Mirmatain] bakri ke do khur hain."
"149","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Qatadah (Raziyallahu anhu) se apne walid se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab namaz ki iqamat kahi jae to khade na ho yahan tak ke mujhe dekh lo.'"
"150","[AI-translation] Hazrat Maimunah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab sajda farmate to [kohniyon ko pahlun se] juda farmate yahan tak ke agar bakri ka bachcha Aap ke neeche se guzarna chahta to guzar jata."
